    "title": "Proposed county budget recommends elimination of Home Health Services - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Luci Weldon ,\n15 hours ago The proposed Warren County budget for fiscal year 2026-27 recommends the elimination of Home Health Services due to reduced caseloads and availability of private-sector providers, resulting in a savings of $309,333. Warren County Manager Crystal Smith presented the proposed budget during the Board of County Commissioners’ Monday night meeting. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
